sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The Test System reports support for<br>component.name CustomizationCtrlr<br>variable.name CustomTriggers<br>variableAttribute.value [Custom1, Custom2, Custom3]
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Use CSMS to trigger custom trigger Custom2 for <Configured evseId>

    CSMS->>CS: TriggerMessageRequest (requestedMessage = CustomTrigger, customTrigger = Custom2, evse.id = <Configured evseId>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message TriggerMessageRequest<br>- requestedMessage CustomTrigger<br>- customTrigger Custom2<br>- evse.id <Configured evseId>

    CS-->>CSMS: TriggerMessageResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
